            "is_preorder": false,
            "datePublished": "25 Feb 2014 01:24:11 GMT",
            "about": "This is effectively a collection of longer and noisier drone tracks that were originally recorded during the production of the fractal series. They all share a similar theme and tone; in essence they belong together. Initially it was planned that these would never see the light of day, but with some small changes it became clear that they work together as a cohesive piece. Everything found here is the direct result of nights spent walking on the side of the road for hours, listening to the cars passing by, and reflecting on personal mistakes.",
